      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ihema isondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wendeleyaga ku'muwi'la Mose ati', “Hangi', u'lav'ezye Ihema Isondo ku' miki'ngo iku'mi zya katani nsoga i'yo yi'pelegilwe, na zya wu'zi wa langi ya bululu, zambalawo na yazaa. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo u'lazityane ku' wu'tonto ku' kolwa masu'mbano ga v'akelubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muki'ngo gu'lav'e na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na iv'i'li', na wu'gali'nhu wago mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyeni'zyo zyose zilav'e zya ki'pimo ki'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lalu'ngye ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo, na miki'ngo zingi' itano ziv'e muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lasumi'le ngovyo zya langi ya bululu ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa kwandya, na vyene vivyo u'lasumi'le ngovyo zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano zingi' ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li', nazyo ngovyo zyose zilinge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lav'ezye visikizo maku'mi atano vya zahabu, ki'gele vilu'ngi'zye i'zyo miki'ngo iv'i'li', na ku'ziv'ezya ziv'e ki'ntu' ki'mo ku'nguno ya ihema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'ezye nfundi' ya ihema ku' miki'ngo iku'mi na gu'mo zya wu'yenze wa mbu'li. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la muki'ngo gu'lav'e na wu'lihu wa mita iku'mi na idatu', na wu'gali'nhu mita iv'i'li'. Miki'ngo zyose iku'mi na gu'mo zilav'e na ki'pimo ki'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lazilu'ngye ku' ku'suma miki'ngo itano ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo, na i'zyo miki'ngo zingi' mukaga ziv'e muki'ngo gu'mo. Ali'vi muki'ngo gwa mukaga u'lagu'gonde kamo ha mbele ya ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lav'ezye ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gu'mo, na ngovyo maku'mi atano ku' ipi'ndo lya muki'ngo gwa wu'v'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye visikizo maku'mi atano vya shaba, na ku'vingi'zya mu i'zyo ngovyo, ki'gele ku'yi'lu'ngya nfundi' ya ihema yi'v'e ki'ntu' ki'mo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'pande cha muki'ngo i'cho ki'li'sigali'la ki'lenene ku' lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, na nusu ya muki'ngo gwa ku' mpelo yi'lasyelembe ha nsi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'pande ki'ngi' ki'lenene mu mbazu zya ihema na ki'lagu'v'i'te muki'ngo gwa mugati' nusu mita, ki'gele ku'li'kumbi'la mpaka ha nsi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye nfundi' ya ihema ku' ndi'li' zya ng'ondi i'zyo ziv'ililwe langi yazaa, na ha igu'lya yayo u'lav'ezye nfundi' yi'ngi' ya ndi'li' zya ndimu zingi' zya mu nyanza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'ezye felemu ku'tu'mi'la mbawo zya mugu'nga zya ku'ki'ndi'ki'la ihema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la felemu yi'lav'e na mbawo iv'i'li' zya wu'lihu wa mita ine, na wu'gali'nhu wa maba sentimita maku'mi mukaga na mukaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki'la lu'bawo lu'v'e na lu'li'mi lu'mo lwa ku'sopeka ku' kikali'lo. Felemu zyose zya ihema u'laziv'ezezye ndi'mi iv'i'li' iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye felemu maku'mi av'i'li' ku' lwandi' lwa dakama lwa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na vikali'lo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza vya ku'tu'u'la ha nsi'li'li' na zyeni'zyo felemu maku'mi av'i'li'. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li', ki'gele zidimi'li'le i'zyo ndi'mi zyayo iv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lav'ezye felemu zingi' maku'mi av'i'li' ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa sukuma lwa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na vikali'lo vyazyo maku'mi ane vya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lav'ezye felemu mukaga ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'go gu'li' ku' mweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' u'lav'ezye felemu zingi' iv'i'li' ku'nguno ya vituzi vya ihema ku' lwandi' lwalyo lwa ku' mupi'ndo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' vituzi vyeni'vyo viv'i'li' felemu zyeni'zyo zilaki'ndi'kwe yi'mo yi'mo ku' ki'la ki'tuzi kwandi'zya ha nsi' mpaka ku' igu'lya, na ki'la felemu yi'ladimwe na pete ku' ki'tuzi ku' igu'lya. Felemu zyeni'zyo iv'i'li' ziv'eziwe vyene vivyo ki'gele ziv'ezye vituzi viv'i'li'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo ziv'eho felemu munane ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, na vikali'lo iku'mi na mukaga zya mawe ga feza. Ki'la felemu yi'v'e na vikali'lo viv'i'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“U'lav'ezye ngito zya muti' gwa mugu'nga: ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lu'mo lwa ihema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngito itano ku'nguno ya lwandi' lwa wu'v'i'li', na ngito itano ku'nguno ya felemu zya lwandi' lwa ku' mupi'ndo gwa ihema, u'lo lu'li' ku' mweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugati' nazyo, lu'gito lu'mo lu'lav'i'te hagati' na felemu ku'fuma ku' mpelo yi'mo mpaka ku' mpelo yi'ngi'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Felemu zyose u'lazikumbi'le zahabu na ku'ziv'ezezya pete zya zahabu i'zyo ziladimi'li'le ngito zyeni'zyo. Hangi' na ngito u'lazikumbi'le zahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U'lali'v'ezye Ihema Isondo lyeni'lo ku'gelani'la na wikole u'wo naku'lagi'lile ku' lu'gu'lu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.26.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
